Bundle-Name: Model Atlas Configuration Checks
Bundle-Description: Reports configuration properties a component does not declare. \
 Declarative Services drops an unrecognised property in silence, which is how `parent.scope` \
 sat in six shipped configurations while the component read `scope.parent` (issue #261). \
 Depends on nothing but the JDK, so it can move to a fennec utility bundle unchanged.

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.annotation.versioning,\
	org.osgi.annotation.bundle

-testpath: junit-jupiter-api
